     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Parts and sequence",
     "texto": [
      "A narrative usually presents the situation and the characters, develops a conflict and reaches a resolution. The order can be linear or include memories of earlier events.",
      "**Alur maju** moves forward following chronology; **alur mundur** returns to an earlier moment. To analyze the story, distinguish the order in which events happen from the order in which they are told."
     ],
